  "hotScore": 128.96,
  "textRawHtml": "<p>用 claude code 写的代码</p>\n<pre><code># 子集聚合全部改成掩码列，取代循环里的 kills/killed/npc/rev/paid 五次切片\n    d[\"_paid\"] = ((d[\"is_revive\"] == 1) &amp; (d[\"irevivemoney\"] &gt; 0)).astype(int)\n    d[\"_kill_tgt\"] = d[\"votherroleid\"].where(d[\"is_kill\"] == 1)\n    d[\"_killed_src\"] = d[\"votherroleid\"].where(d[\"is_killed_by_role\"] == 1)\n    d[\"_rev_type\"] = d[\"irevivetype\"].where(d[\"is_revive\"] == 1)\n    d[\"_paid_money\"] = d[\"irevivemoney\"].where(d[\"_paid\"] == 1)\n    d[\"_red\"] = (utils.to_num(d[\"ikilledred\"]).fillna(0) if has_killedred\n                 else pd.Series(0.0, index=d.index))\n    gb = d.groupby(\"roleid\", sort=False)\n</code></pre>\n<p>全是这样的，完全看不懂！但是让 agent 讲解一看，确实又高效又简洁，但是很难看懂啊。到底审还是不审核</p>\n",
  "textZhHtml": "<p>用 claude code 写的代码</p>\n<pre><code># 子集聚合全部改成掩码列，取代循环里的 kills/killed/npc/rev/paid 五次切片\n    d[\"_paid\"] = ((d[\"is_revive\"] == 1) &amp; (d[\"irevivemoney\"] &gt; 0)).astype(int)\n    d[\"_kill_tgt\"] = d[\"votherroleid\"].where(d[\"is_kill\"] == 1)\n    d[\"_killed_src\"] = d[\"votherroleid\"].where(d[\"is_killed_by_role\"] == 1)\n    d[\"_rev_type\"] = d[\"irevivetype\"].where(d[\"is_revive\"] == 1)\n    d[\"_paid_money\"] = d[\"irevivemoney\"].where(d[\"_paid\"] == 1)\n    d[\"_red\"] = (utils.to_num(d[\"ikilledred\"]).fillna(0) if has_killedred\n                 else pd.Series(0.0, index=d.index))\n    gb = d.groupby(\"roleid\", sort=False)\n</code></pre>\n<p>全是这样的，完全看不懂！但是让 agent 讲解一看，确实又高效又简洁，但是很难看懂啊。到底审还是不审核</p>\n",
